msgstr "2011-festival-1000x0-c-default"

msgctxt "body.5b74dcc8-c014-4180-b956-cf15ddd26a9f.items.43c07235-739b-4ae1-9cb5-611fa405fc98.header"
msgid "2011"
msgstr "2011"

msgctxt "body.5b74dcc8-c014-4180-b956-cf15ddd26a9f.items.43c07235-739b-4ae1-9cb5-611fa405fc98.title"
msgid "London Calling"
msgstr "London Calling"

msgctxt "body.5b74dcc8-c014-4180-b956-cf15ddd26a9f.items.43c07235-739b-4ae1-9cb5-611fa405fc98.description"
msgid "Along with the change in cities came a change in name, and the Mozilla Festival was solidified as a gathering place for Mozilla’s global network."
msgstr "Le changement de ville s’est accompagné d’un changement de nom, et le Mozilla Festival est devenu le lieu de rencontre incontournable du réseau mondial de Mozilla."

msgctxt "body.5b74dcc8-c014-4180-b956-cf15ddd26a9f.items.811cff17-9220-406c-be71-97e88c7c09bd.image.alt_text"
msgid "2012-humanAPI"
msgstr "2012-humanAPI"

msgctxt "body.5b74dcc8-c014-4180-b956-cf15ddd26a9f.items.811cff17-9220-406c-be71-97e88c7c09bd.header"
msgid "2012"
msgstr "2012"

msgctxt "body.5b74dcc8-c014-4180-b956-cf15ddd26a9f.items.811cff17-9220-406c-be71-97e88c7c09bd.title"
msgid "Generation of Webmakers"
msgstr "Une génération de créateurs du Web"

msgctxt "body.5b74dcc8-c014-4180-b956-cf15ddd26a9f.items.811cff17-9220-406c-be71-97e88c7c09bd.description"
msgid "MozFest’s third year marked the rise of the maker spirit. We invested more in nurturing grassroots innovators doing incredible work in their communities."
msgstr ""
"La troisième édition du MozFest a marqué l’essor de l’esprit créateur. Nous avons investi davantage dans l’accompagnement des innovateurs de terrain qui accomplissent un travail remarquable au sein "
"de leurs communautés."

msgctxt "body.5b74dcc8-c014-4180-b956-cf15ddd26a9f.items.78bbb3d0-9548-4bf4-9c87-a1c381790916.image.alt_text"
msgid "2014-Making-Learning-Relevant-1-1500x0-c-default (1)"
msgstr "2014-Making-Learning-Relevant-1-1500x0-c-default (1)"

msgctxt "body.5b74dcc8-c014-4180-b956-cf15ddd26a9f.items.78bbb3d0-9548-4bf4-9c87-a1c381790916.header"
msgid "2014"
msgstr "2014"

msgctxt "body.5b74dcc8-c014-4180-b956-cf15ddd26a9f.items.78bbb3d0-9548-4bf4-9c87-a1c381790916.title"
msgid "Teach the Web"
msgstr "Apprendre à maîtriser le Web"

msgctxt "body.5b74dcc8-c014-4180-b956-cf15ddd26a9f.items.78bbb3d0-9548-4bf4-9c87-a1c381790916.description"
msgid "Web literacy and access took center stage. MozFest became a platform for app-makers, artists, and educators to push boundaries and inspire."
msgstr ""
"La culture numérique et l’accès au Web sont devenus des enjeux centraux. Le MozFest est devenu une plateforme permettant aux développeurs d’applications, aux artistes et aux éducateurs de repousser "
"les limites et d’inspirer les autres."

msgctxt "body.5b74dcc8-c014-4180-b956-cf15ddd26a9f.items.071929f7-0fd7-4c8d-8c0a-701912300215.image.alt_text"
msgid "2015-advocacy"
msgstr "2015-advocacy"

msgctxt "body.5b74dcc8-c014-4180-b956-cf15ddd26a9f.items.071929f7-0fd7-4c8d-8c0a-701912300215.header"
msgid "2015"
msgstr "2015"

msgctxt "body.5b74dcc8-c014-4180-b956-cf15ddd26a9f.items.071929f7-0fd7-4c8d-8c0a-701912300215.title"
msgid "Collaborative Curation"
msgstr "Sélection collaborative"

msgctxt "body.5b74dcc8-c014-4180-b956-cf15ddd26a9f.items.071929f7-0fd7-4c8d-8c0a-701912300215.description"
msgid "MozFest responded to growing threats to digital rights, with the community coming together to co-create a festival focused on safety, privacy, and the future of the open web."
msgstr "Le MozFest a répondu aux menaces croissantes à l’encontre des droits numériques, en se réunissant pour co-créer un festival axé sur la sécurité, la confidentialité et l’avenir du Web ouvert."

msgctxt "body.5b74dcc8-c014-4180-b956-cf15ddd26a9f.items.c5eedd4b-5abc-44e0-a091-ffc43b430ab8.image.alt_text"
